    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hero's Ignition</strong> reimagines the 80s classic H.E.R.O. with modern 3D graphics, pulling you into intricate underground cave systems. You control a character equipped with a propeller device to soar gracefully through passages that blend retro charm with dynamic action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience combat and puzzles as you wield a flamethrower in a twin-stick shooter style, strategically place dynamite to negotiate obstacles, and navigate a dynamic underground environment.\u00a0This game seeks to pay tribute to the original while expanding on gameplay mechanics into a new era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flight-Powered Exploration</strong>: Use a propeller device to glide through sprawling, atmospheric cave systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twin-Stick Flamethrower Action</strong>: Experience arcade-style combat with a modern twist as you wield a powerful flamethrower</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explosive Dynamics</strong>: Strategically place dynamite to alter your surroundings and overcome obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intricate Platform Puzzles</strong>: Tackle puzzles that involve manipulating underground steam vents, boulders, gas exhausts, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modern 3D Immersion</strong>: Enjoy retro-inspired adventure enhanced with vibrant, contemporary 3D graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Underground Mysteries</strong>: Uncover secrets, dodge perilous traps, and engage with a host of challenges lurking in the depths</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hero's Ignition</strong> reimagines the 80s classic H.E.R.O. with modern 3D graphics, pulling you into intricate underground cave systems. You control a character equipped with a propeller device to soar gracefully through passages that blend retro charm with dynamic action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience combat and puzzles as you wield a flamethrower in a twin-stick shooter style, strategically place dynamite to negotiate obstacles, and navigate a dynamic underground environment.\u00a0This game seeks to pay tribute to the original while expanding on gameplay mechanics into a new era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flight-Powered Exploration</strong>: Use a propeller device to glide through sprawling, atmospheric cave systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twin-Stick Flamethrower Action</strong>: Experience arcade-style combat with a modern twist as you wield a powerful flamethrower</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explosive Dynamics</strong>: Strategically place dynamite to alter your surroundings and overcome obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intricate Platform Puzzles</strong>: Tackle puzzles that involve manipulating underground steam vents, boulders, gas exhausts, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modern 3D Immersion</strong>: Enjoy retro-inspired adventure enhanced with vibrant, contemporary 3D graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Underground Mysteries</strong>: Uncover secrets, dodge perilous traps, and engage with a host of challenges lurking in the depths</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Inspired by the iconic 80s classic H.E.R.O., wield your weapons and propeller-powered device as you navigate perilous underground depths. Retro charm meets modern innovation in an adventure reimagined for today\u2019s explorers!",
